This directory must EXIST and contain no SKILL.md. That is the whole fixture: audit_codex reads
a present-but-empty .agents/skills/ as "codex was selected and translated nothing" (err), and an
ABSENT one as "codex was never selected" (anchor). Git does not track empty directories, so
without this file the case ships as a missing directory, flips to the anchor path, and exits 0 —
which is what happened on CI while it passed locally off an untracked directory on disk.
